cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MorphoStack, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MorphoStack"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-09"
abstract: >-
  Local morphometry toolkit for microscopy Z-stacks (vesicle/GUV analysis,
  RBC shape analysis, and experimental active-surfaces). Provides CLI,
  FastAPI backend, browser UI, calibrated metrics, mesh export, and
  reproducible run manifests.
authors:
